'' RUN: std/fs phase P7 -- HomeDir, ConfigDir, DataDir, CacheDir and StateDir against the
'' platform's own answer (the environment the Windows shell folders mirror; on Linux the XDG
'' variables and $HOME, then the passwd entry); ExecutablePath is this program; ExpandHome
'' expands only "~", "~/" and "~\".
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/fs-p7.tiko -o tests/codegen/fsp7.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/fsp7.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/fsp7.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
